OL,3,GNEWSAFurther BBC cuts could undermine
OL,4,Afunding model, union leader warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Scotland director Hayley Valentine
OL,7,Fsaid last month that BBC Scotland would
OL,8,Ffocus resources "where they will have
OL,9,Fthe greatest impact for audiences" as
OL,10,Fit contends with financial challenges.
